  "Question": "Construct the perpendicular bisector of segment $AB$ with a straightedge and compass. It intersects $AB$ at $M$. If $AB=7.6\\text{ cm}$, what is the length of $AM$? (Unit: cm)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "3.8",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "$M$ is the midpoint of $AB$, so $AM=7.6\\div 2=3.8$.",
